{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短停留页，未标时点的感受词仍然偏密，实际扫读压力高于X；少数意象也有过度发挥的感觉。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的双栏结构更利于快速扫过，短时间内不容易被感受词淹没。但Y用加亮关键词把每段的转折、动机和心理矛盾凸显出来，又用随音乐出现的感受提示呈现情绪变化，观众更容易理解他为什么从试探、放松走向害怕失去，最后选择不再隐藏。水波、小船、漂浮等反复出现的意象，以及更具体的声部、力度和停顿描写，也让整首曲子的情绪前后相连，细腻度胜过X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b723244a-de99-4238-8521-09b4630c96a3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230722394070Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:09:44.035111+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4c4508bb5adba95ae8857bca3a873f56537d3ceb99f6f8ab0df0f1b0b3e0c405", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment